			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"莫娜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 105020401,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們終於回來了，等得我好無聊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020402,
					"content": "本來還想看看書打發時間，結果這居然是一本莫名其妙的日記，一點意思都沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020403,
					"content": "明明是從可莉的包裡掉出來的，我還以為記載了什麼古代知識呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020404,
					"content": "不管了，所以，箱子找到了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020405,
					"content": "找到啦，完好無損！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020406,
					"content": "那太好了——等等？！為、為什麼沒有鎖著？！裡面…呃！裡面又為什麼是空的啊？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020407,
					"content": "咦——？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020408,
					"content": "是這樣的，因為我借用了這個箱子，用來裝我收集的寶貝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020409,
					"content": "借用？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020410,
					"content": "現在姐姐要收回這個箱子，所以我就把我的寶貝都拿了出來，箱子就是空的了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020411,
					"content": "妳用來裝妳的東西了？！…那、那原本裡面裝著的東西呢？我要的是那個！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020412,
					"content": "哦，姐姐原來是要以前裝在箱子裡面的東西…早說嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020413,
					"content": "妳…該不會把它弄壞了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020414,
					"content": "沒有！一點都沒弄壞哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020415,
					"content": "呼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020416,
					"content": "那件東西，就是姐姐手裡的那本書呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020417,
					"content": "咿——？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020418,
					"content": "這、這…原來這書，這日記…是老太婆的…難道是她五十年前的日記？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020419,
					"content": "時隔五十年要回收的，是她少女時代的黑歷史嗎？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020420,
					"content": "完了！難怪…！難怪老太婆說…無論如何都不能看，看了就要把我大卸八塊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020421,
					"content": "我，我是不是闖禍了…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020422,
					"content": "啊！是姐姐說想要箱子的，沒說裡面東西的事情！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020423,
					"content": "我什麼都不知道！我先走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020424,
						105020425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020424,
					"content": "真是個感人的結局…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020426
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020426,
					"content": "唔…不過，只要莫娜不說，妳的師父也不知道妳看過日記了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020427,
					"content": "不可能，占星術能看破一切謊言，你們也都見識過了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020428,
					"content": "啊…花光所有摩拉來了蒙德，沒有得到知識，現在也回不去了，怎麼會變成這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020429,
					"content": "好可憐…要不然，就等妳把書裡的內容都忘光了，再回去吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020430,
					"content": "這個…太難了，而且就算我想留在蒙德城，也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020431,
						105020433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020431,
					"content": "沒有面子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020432
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020432,
					"content": "是的，如果我和這些俗人生活在一起，占星術士的心境要怎麼維持…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020435,
					"content": "那也沒辦法，不然妳就只能回去見妳的師父。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020436,
					"content": "別、別說了！那、那，就先這樣吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020437,
					"content": "我決定了，暫時住在蒙德城吧。等老太婆的命數到了盡頭，我就自由了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020438,
						105020439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020438,
					"content": "真是過分堅定的覺悟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020440
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020440,
					"content": "可是，占星術的研究要怎麼辦…不對，首先連住的地方都沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020441,
					"content": "關於這個，我們去問一下<color=#00E1FFFF>冒險家協會的凱瑟琳小姐</color>，能不能幫忙吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020442,
					"content": "#冒險家協會？嗯…對，如果能透過接他們的委託，換取…嗯，{F#妳}{M#你}懂吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020443,
						105020444
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020443,
					"content": "瞭解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020445
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020445,
					"content": "唔，謝謝…那個，我…算了，沒什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020444,
					"content": "本來也是這麼打算的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020445
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020439,
					"content": "這也算是「暫時」嗎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020440
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020433,
					"content": "沒有錢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020434,
					"content": "#是…唔，不是！{F#妳}{M#你}還真是不會說話啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020425,
					"content": "對可莉發脾氣也是沒用的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020426
					]
				}
			]
		},
