					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020603,
					"content": "我看看，嗯…原來如此，只需要這樣，然後這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020604,
					"content": "好了，打開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020605,
					"content": "哇，真厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020606,
					"content": "只要回去和凱瑟琳報告一下，應該就可以住進去了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020607,
					"content": "不必了不必了，太謝謝你們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020608,
					"content": "這位是…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020609,
					"content": "哦，我是這棟房子的主人，歌德。剛剛路過冒險家協會的時候，凱瑟琳告訴了我這件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020610,
					"content": "沒想到這麼快，這個煩人的封印就被解開了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020611,
					"content": "那就是說，我可以住在這裡了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020612,
					"content": "當然當然，反正裡面的設備放著也是放著，能有人發揮它們的價值，我也很開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020613,
					"content": "為了表示感謝，我可以用最低最低的價格，把房子租給妳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020614,
					"content": "租、租？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020615,
					"content": "來之前沒聽說租的事，而且我還幫了忙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020616,
					"content": "幫忙？嗯，對，我明白啊。我非常感謝妳，所以租金肯定會給妳最優惠的價格！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020617,
					"content": "我、我的意思是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020618,
					"content": "看來莫娜有些誤解，但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020619,
						105020620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020619,
					"content": "這可能是最好的選擇了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020621,
					"content": "唉…也沒有別的辦法了，就租這裡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020622,
					"content": "好！那就這麼說定了，我去準備一下手續，稍等片刻吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020623,
					"content": "#這次的事，謝謝了。還有就是…很對不起，答應{F#妳}{M#你}的事，暫時還做不到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020624,
					"content": "#沒有占星需要的設備，也沒有新的知識，想要看清{F#妳}{M#你}的「命運」，還需要一些時間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020625,
					"content": "#但我答應{F#妳}{M#你}，等我準備好了，我一定會第一個為{F#妳}{M#你}占卜的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020626,
						105020628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020626,
					"content": "如妳所說，這次旅程有益無害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020627,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}，能和{F#妳}{M#你}同行是我的命運——而且，算是「好運」的那一邊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020630,
					"content": "祝你們的冒險一路順風！我…也要想想以後的事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020631,
					"content": "如果她不用占星術賺錢，要怎麼活下去呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020632,
					"content": "…我們還是偶爾回來看看她吧？要是餓暈在房間裡，就不好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020628,
					"content": "總之先努力活下去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020629
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020629,
					"content": "嗯…雖然我不知道該怎麼辦，但…我會努力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020620,
					"content": "摩拉賺一賺總是會有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020621
					]
				}
			]
		},
